413 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 99 0 R
/E (They acted upon what they knew, and did not overburden themselves. Thus, they did not mix guidance with misguidance.)
/Pg 25 0 R
/K [10]
>>
endobj
414 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 99 0 R
/E (And they are the evidences for the confused ones, whoever walks by their guidance will not fear misguidance.)
/Pg 25 0 R
/K [11]
>>
endobj
415 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 99 0 R
/E (And they are the stars in guidance and illumination, and in loftiness of rank, and in unattainable reach.)
/Pg 25 0 R
/K [12]
>>
endobj
416 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 99 0 R
